    B=8  T=8192    -> logits   16.00 GiB bf16,   32.00 GiB with the backward
    B=4  T=32768   -> logits   32.00 GiB bf16,   64.00 GiB with the backward
    B=1  T=262144  -> logits   64.00 GiB bf16,  128.00 GiB with the backward

